 "story": {
  "bossIntro": "The Latency Loop wakes: Every photon you fired comes back late. Catch your own echo and snap the circle!",
  "defeat": [
   "Diagnostics scattered, but the bench is still live. Reboot the skiff, Boz.",
   "The glasses hold. You will tune the light and close that loop next run."
  ],
  "intro": [
   "Connect keynote in T-minus minutes. The prototype glasses just threw a photon wobble.",
   "You, Boz, shrink to diagnostic scale and launch your skiff into the optical stack.",
   "Fly left to right through glass and light, tune the stack, and ship it on time."
  ],
  "levelIntros": [
   "Sensor Rail: The outer rail is live. Cameras blink, shutters flutter, dust motes swarm the line.",
   "Waveguide Maze: Pure light in etched glass. Every corridor is a mirror hall of signal and color.",
   "Power Budget: The battery budget is glowing. Skirt the heat spikes and ride the efficient line."
  ],
  "victory": [
   "Stack tuned. Photons locked. Boz, you closed the loop and the glasses are keynote ready.",
   "The stage lights find clear glass. Future's in focus, and you flew it there."
  ]
 },
